  "schema:version": "2.0.0",
  "schema:name": "BGS OGE bedrock and surface geology",
  "schema:description": "The 1:625k DiGMap data covering the whole of the United Kingdom is available in this OGC WFS service for your personal, non-commercial use only and was being served as a contribution to the OneGeology-Europe initiative, which has now ended; see https://www.europe-geology.eu/project/onegeology-europe/ for details. The contents of this WFS service were not intended for direct use but were transformed by a mediator layer into separate WFS services which provided data in GeoSciML; the mediator is no longer maintained. For information about more of the British Geological Survey's maps that are available digitally please visit https://www.bgs.ac.uk/products/digitalmaps/digmapgb.html.",
